  <section xml:id="app-matrix-tools">
    <title>Matrix Tools for Multivariable Calculus</title>
    <p>
  This section reviews selected topics from linear algebra that arise naturally in multivariable calculus,
  including matrices, determinants, and related ideas. The material is presented as a brief refresher to
  support recall and application, rather than a full development of the subject.
</p>
    <p>[Placeholder: Jacobian/Hessian, RREF, determinants, eigenvalues, etc.]</p>
  </section>

